cluding GH-258 typo keys, keep their own messages."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"All three variants (generic, unknown-key, repeated-key) name the segment, and executing the emitted retry links a.txt with the full note text"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"A files/docs --add refusal caused by note prose names the misread segment and key and offers the same link with the prose moved to --note"}],"before_hash":"1f7d87f15658a235ae388c5e9ed500edbc1bd3de75a3a927110509f913499395","after_hash":"662fff3b90fdbdb09b1462bbd390ebe14b5792c51c4e21051459aa79c8368ea3","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-11T08:02:13.936Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c2650ac101ead477bf12421d9b38c8ad195a30418c678b2f1e397dfc47f01919"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-11T08:02:18.680Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6ba0f6f7044b066fe23d5ec","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"release-operator","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-4yxzvd","claim:pm-oglm0t","claim:pm-pwqiao","claim:pm-tuxw1i","release:pm-gh1700"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-4yxzvd+pm-oglm0t+pm-pwqiao+pm-tuxw1i","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-4yxzvd","claim:pm-oglm0t","claim:pm-pwqiao","claim:pm-tuxw1i","release:pm-gh1700"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"release","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-11T08:02:18.680Z"}],"before_hash":"662fff3b90fdbdb09b1462bbd390ebe14b5792c51c4e21051459aa79c8368ea3","after_hash":"7ff3e03bd0b000ed8d1a1c36a0cf26a713370a3be65eff69912a6531ab0f3239","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"be27820b713c7a5431057afdb10d93c0f8ca5c0004a75377ef325006037d17e7"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-11T08:42:37.974Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6ba0f6f7044b066fe23d5ec","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-11T08:42:37.974Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-11T08:42:37.973Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"PR 1705 review round 1 (Greptile P1 and Codex P2), fixed. The recovery used to rebuild one entry with a regex, which broke in two cases. A quoted path such as path=\"a,note=literal.txt\" was matched inside the quotes. A later link key such as scope=global was folded into the note. The retry also dropped --migrate, --remove and --add-glob. findMisreadNoteSegment now reads the entry with splitStructuredEntrySegments (src/core/item/parse.ts), which uses parseCsvKv's own quote and escape rules. Link keys before the note, and a non-repeated path or scope after it, stay link fields; every other later segment is note prose. The entry is rewritten with the note JSON-quoted (note=\"...\"). The retry replays the whole invocation from the resolved values: every --add, --add-glob, --remove, --migrate, --note, --append-stable, --validate-paths, --full-history, --author, --message and --force. Executing it was proven for the migration and removal case, a quoted path, a later scope key, embedded quotes and a URL in the prose."}]}],"before_hash":"7ff3e03bd0b000ed8d1a1c36a0cf26a713370a3be65eff69912a6531ab0f3239","after_hash":"176959011ade5a821c897be7fabb60024655cf2ce6029781fb2d02d33d631a5f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"41b9430845c60fa69c5805f4937be9b5f345bb4e182ff293761b9dfbdfab3b47"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-11T09:27:35.915Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6ba0f6f7044b066fe23d5ec","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-11T09:27:35.915Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"PR 1705 review round 2 (Greptile P1 and P2, Codex P1 and P2), fixed. First, the retry dropped revision guards. It now replays activeItemRevisionExpectations as --expect-hash=<id>=<hash>, which covers CLI --expect-hash as well as SDK and MCP scopes, verified through the built CLI. When the guards cannot be spelled as one invocation (nested scopes expecting different revisions), the executable retry is withheld and required names the rewritten entry. Second, escaped commas in link fields were unescaped by the splitter. Segments now carry their raw source (splitCsvSegmentRanges backs both parseCsvKv and the diagnosis), so path=d\\\\,e.txt survives. Third, an already-quoted note value kept its quotes as data. The first note value is decoded with parseCsvKv's unquoteValue before continuations join it."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-11T09:27:35.915Z"}],"before_hash":"176959011ade5a821c897be7fabb60024655cf2ce6029781fb2d02d33d631a5f","after_hash":"4f234fead9b032c824ef5fb5702dd0f7435ac061a19a4ebb43b887e02d240b91","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0456f42529389c1913856496ace40a4e69c9d8c88213ecce79a6ddbf55b0887d"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-11T09:27:49.378Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6ba0f6f7044b066fe23d5ec","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_edit","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/comments/1/text","value":"PR 1705 review round 2 (Greptile P1 and P2, Codex P1 and P2), fixed. First, the retry dropped revision guards. It now replays activeItemRevisionExpectations as --expect-hash=<id>=<hash>, which covers CLI --expect-hash as well as SDK and MCP scopes, verified through the built CLI. When the guards cannot be spelled as one invocation (nested scopes expecting different revisions), the executable retry is withheld and required names the rewritten entry. Second, escaped commas in link fields were unescaped by the splitter. Segments now carry their raw source (splitCsvSegmentRanges backs both parseCsvKv and the diagnosis), so path=d\\,e.txt survives. Third, an already-quoted note value kept its quotes as data. The first note value is decoded with parseCsvKv's unquoteValue before continuations join it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1/edited_at","value":"2026-11-11T09:27:49.377Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-11T09:27:49.378Z"}],"before_hash":"4f234fead9b032c824ef5fb5702dd0f7435ac061a19a4ebb43b887e02d240b91","after_hash":"9d6f5b2d8a4c3f5fcc8fa9292e77a428e339e0759e254424c5acc9193e93acf1","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"97094bd97ffc57cabf81a9a3